 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"e4bd15f0-7de3-45e3-87c1-8d6541c6dc49"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A low-level helper: it resolves vertex placements and propagator shapes \
through the FeynArts shape database and returns one ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "FeynArts`DiagramGraphics"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "aa3029b4-9d87-4791-8dcd-8a38ca44d817"],
 " object per insertion."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"fb965e19-692c-4298-bfc6-c6a5e568d43f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FeynArtsTopologyGraphics"]], 
    "paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/FeynArtsTopologyGraphics", 
    "Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c2769b98-3c03-4749-a63e-fa694d0af4a0"],
 " wraps this and renders the result to ordinary ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Graphics"]], "paclet:ref/Graphics"},
